{%- comment -%}
  YOINK SKATE SHOP — the mission band.

  SPLIT OUT OF `aj-grind` ON 25 Aug 2026. See `aj-grind-categories.liquid`.

  THIS BAND USED TO NAME THE SHOPS, AND DELIBERATELY NO LONGER DOES. Alex's
  call, 17 Aug 2026: sell their products, do not advertise them. Listing the
  suppliers by name sends a reader off to buy direct, and it also writes a
  promise this page then has to keep — the moment a named shop stops stocking,
  the band is a lie until someone remembers to edit it.

  So what is left is the argument itself, which is true whoever is stocking it
  and needs no maintenance. If named shops ever come back they should come back
  as real data, not as three text fields somebody has to keep in step.

  INDEPENDENT, NOT NEARBY. The argument is not "buy local to you" — a customer in
  Mesa is not closer to any of these shops than to a warehouse. It is that the
  money goes to an independent skate shop rather than to a distributor. Copy
  here should never imply proximity, because that promise would be false for
  almost every reader.

  GATED ON THE STATEMENT, not on the section being present: clearing the body
  removes the band. That was true when this was one element of a page and is
  kept now that removing it is also possible by deleting the section — the two
  are not the same thing, because the band still has to vanish cleanly for
  anyone who empties the field instead.

  CLASS NAMES STAY `__shops-*`. They predate the rename and the CSS is working;
  repainting markup to match new copy is not worth the risk.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'aj-grind.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
-%}

{%- if s.mission_body != blank -%}
  <div class="aj-grind" style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}">
    <div class="aj-grind__shops-band">
      <div class="page-width aj-grind__section">
        {%- if s.mission_eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="aj-grind__eyebrow aj-grind__eyebrow--on-dark">{{ s.mission_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.mission_heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="aj-grind__h2 aj-grind__h2--on-dark">{{ s.mission_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p class="aj-grind__shops-body">{{ s.mission_body | escape }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Skate — Mission",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Deliberately does not name the shops — see the note in the file. Clearing the statement removes the whole band." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mission_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Why this exists" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mission_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Bought from a shop, not a warehouse" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "mission_body", "label": "Statement",
      "default": "Skate shops are independent, outnumbered and closing. Everything here is stocked by one of them, so the money goes to people who have stood on a board rather than to a distributor who has not." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-start", "label": "Top padding", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-end", "label": "Bottom padding", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 0 }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "AJ Skate — Mission" }]
}
{% endschema %}
